<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; color:#000000; bEditID:r3st1; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: medium;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><font face="Verdana" size="2"><strong>Send Email to</strong>&nbsp;- Finance and CR dept</font></span></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: medium;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><font face="Verdana" size="2"><br></font></span></div><font face="Verdana" size="2" style=""><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">Hi,</p><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></p><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">Please find attached the free trial request for<br><br><u></u></p><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></p><font face="arial"><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><u></u></span></font><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><u>Account Information:<br></u><strong>PL&nbsp;Name</strong>&nbsp;-&nbsp;{!Opportunity.Account}<br><strong>PL ID</strong>&nbsp;-&nbsp;{!Opportunity.Id}<br><strong>PL&nbsp;Industry</strong>&nbsp;- {!Account.Industry}<font size="3"><font size="2"><br><strong>A</strong></font></font><strong>ddress</strong>&nbsp;- {!Account.ShippingStreet} {!Account.ShippingCity}<font size="3"><font size="2">, {!Account.ShippingState} {!Account.ShippingPostalCode},&nbsp;</font><font size="2">{!Account.ShippingCountry}</font><font size="2"></font></font></p><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font size="3"><font size="2"><br></font></font></p><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><font size="3" face="arial"></font></span><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font size="3"></font><u>User&nbsp;Contact Information:</u><br><font size="2"><strong>Name</strong>&nbsp;-&nbsp;{!Contact.FirstName} {!Contact.LastName}<font size="3"><font size="2"><br></font></font><strong>Email</strong>&nbsp;-&nbsp;{!Contact.Email}<font size="3"><font size="2"><br></font></font></font><font size="2"><strong>Phone</strong>&nbsp;- {!Contact.Phone}<font size="3"><font size="2"></font></font></font></p><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font size="2"><br></font></p><p align="left" style=""><font size="2" style=""><strong style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">Sales Rep Name</strong><font face="arial"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">&nbsp;-&nbsp;</span></font><font style=""><font size="2" style="">{!Opportunity.OwnerFullName}<br></font></font></font><font size="2" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br><br>Special Instructions (if they apply):</font></p><p align="left" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font size="2"><br></font></p><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font size="2">This has also been approved by my manager, enclosed is the email.</font></p><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font size="2"><br></font></p><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font size="2">Regards,<br>&lt;Enter Signature&gt;</font></p></font>]]></td>
